				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$\Theta (R_{i} ,R_{j} ) = \frac{1}{3}\{ [H_{1} (R_{i} ) - H_{1} (R_{j} )]^{2} + [H_{2} (R_{i} ) - H_{2} (R_{j} )]^{2} + [M(R_{i} ) - M(R_{j} )]^{2} \}$$\end{document}Θ(Ri,Rj)=13{[H1(Ri)-H1(Rj)]2+[H2(Ri)-H2(Rj)]2+[M(Ri)-M(Rj)]2}

For one amino acid property, the correlation can be defined as:\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
